Create this component:

```jsx
function ProductCard({ name, price, inStock }) {
  return (
    <article>
      <h2>{name}</h2>
      <p>${price}</p>
      <p>{inStock ? "In stock" : "Out of stock"}</p>
    </article>
  );
}
```

Render it twice with different values.

